{"id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-proof.md","title":"Proof","display":"df-proof — Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-proof","aliases":["58-df-proof","Proof","Mathematical Proof"],"display":"df-proof — Proof","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-proof</span><span>Proof</span><span>Mathematical Proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof — Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d63c357151e48e9d\" href=\"?note=d63c357151e48e9d\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md\">../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (一阶公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (假设集/理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi_0,\\ldots,\\psi_n \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi_0,\\ldots,\\psi_n \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\)</span> (set-coded proof system)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in V\">\\(\\pi\\in V\\)</span> (finite formula sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineOK}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LineOK}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}line}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LineOK}_S(\\pi,i,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,m,\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi))\\land i\\in m\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\exists j\\in i^k\\;\n\\langle\\{\\langle\\ell,\\pi(j(\\ell))\\rangle:\\ell\\in k\\},\\pi(i)\\rangle\\in\\rho\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof\\text{-}line}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LineOK}_S(\\pi,i,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,m,\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi))\\land i\\in m\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\exists j\\in i^k\\;\n\\langle\\{\\langle\\ell,\\pi(j(\\ell))\\rangle:\\ell\\in k\\},\\pi(i)\\rangle\\in\\rho\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\land\\exists\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules},n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))\\land\\pi(n)=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\leq n\\;\\mathrm{LineOK}_S(\\pi,i,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\land\\exists\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules},n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))\\land\\pi(n)=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\leq n\\;\\mathrm{LineOK}_S(\\pi,i,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>形式证明</strong>: a set-coded finite function of formulas whose final value is the conclusion; inference rules use the upstream premise-sequence/conclusion pair format.</li>\n<li><strong>证明系统</strong>: 通常为 Hilbert 系统、自然演绎或 sequent calculus</li>\n<li><strong>可靠性 (Soundness)</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\varphi \\Rightarrow T \\models \\varphi\">\\(T \\vdash \\varphi \\Rightarrow T \\models \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>完备性 (Completeness)</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\models \\varphi \\Rightarrow T \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(T \\models \\varphi \\Rightarrow T \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>一致性</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Leftrightarrow\">\\(\\Leftrightarrow\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\not\\vdash_T \\bot\">\\(\\not\\vdash_T \\bot\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>可证性断言</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(T \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enderton, A Mathematical Introduction to Logic, §2.3</li>\n<li>Takeuti, Proof Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"d63c357151e48e9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch