m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,m,\\operatorname{ran}(\\pi))\\land i\\in m\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl[\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\exists j\\in i^k\\;\n\\langle\\{\\langle\\ell,\\pi(j(\\ell))\\rangle:\\ell\\in k\\},\\pi(i)\\rangle\\in\\rho\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\land\\exists\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules},n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,n+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))\\land\\pi(n)=\\varphi\\land\\forall i\\leq n\\;\\mathrm{LineOK}_S(\\pi,i,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"T \\vdash \\varphi \\Rightarrow T \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T \\models \\varphi \\Rightarrow T \\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\not\\vdash_T \\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"T \\vdash \\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2530,"backlinks":[{"id":"d63c357151e48e9d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Concrete proof objects are defined in [[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]], provability in [[../batch08/58-df-provable.md]], and arithmetized provability in [[../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md]]."},{"id":"e26933a629751c0c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ (fixed proof system) and $\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]])"},{"id":"7f7f26a10a4215f1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(p